#!/bin/bash
# POST-HOC hollow-book count (scope §15.5): spread > 20% of mid AND bid <= 0.90 x prior mid AND last unchanged — the shape that reaches closed_trades. Three days, 15-min buckets, off-hours + run-in.
cd /home/deploy/dawntrader && set -a && . ./.env && set +a
OUT=/home/deploy/obj0_hollow.csv; echo "day,utc_bucket,snaps,symbols,hollow,symbols_hollow,registered_drops" > $OUT
for day in 2026-08-05 2026-08-27 2026-09-01; do
  tbl="xstock_spot_ticker_snap_$(echo $day | tr - _)"
  psql "$DATABASE_URL" -X -A -t -F, -q -c "set statement_timeout='1500s';" -c "
with s as (
  select symbol, captured_at, bid, ask, last,
         lag(bid) over w as pbid, lag(ask) over w as pask, lag(last) over w as plast, lag(captured_at) over w as pts
  from $tbl where bid > 0 and ask > 0 and (captured_at::time < '13:45' or captured_at::time >= '19:30')
  window w as (partition by symbol order by captured_at)
), ev as (
  select symbol, captured_at,
         (pbid > 0 and pask > 0 and captured_at - pts <= interval '5 minutes' and (ask-bid)/((ask+bid)/2) > 0.20 and bid <= 0.90*((pbid+pask)/2) and last = plast) as hollow,
         (pbid > 0 and pask > 0 and captured_at - pts <= interval '5 minutes' and bid <= pbid*0.90 and abs(ask-pask)/pask < 0.02) as registered
  from s
)
select '$day', to_char(date_trunc('hour', captured_at) + (floor(extract(minute from captured_at)/15)*15) * interval '1 minute', 'HH24:MI'),
       count(*), count(distinct symbol), count(*) filter (where hollow), count(distinct symbol) filter (where hollow), count(*) filter (where registered)
from ev group by 1,2 order by 2;" >> $OUT 2>>/home/deploy/obj0_hollow.err
  echo "$(date -u +%FT%TZ) hollow done $day" >> /home/deploy/obj0_hollow.log
done
echo "$(date -u +%FT%TZ) HOLLOW ALL DONE" >> /home/deploy/obj0_hollow.log
